msgid "Partly supported"
msgstr "Stöds delvis"

#: src/luna/mod.rs:361
msgid ""
"This build needs TIDAL's own Last.fm key, which Tidalfast does not have."
msgstr ""
"Den här versionen behöver TIDALs egen Last.fm-nyckel, som Tidalfast inte har."

#: src/luna/mod.rs:365
msgid ""
"It saves TIDAL songs as files, which Tidalfast does not allow (use Download "
"in Tidalfast to listen offline)."
msgstr ""
"Den sparar TIDAL-låtar som filer, vilket Tidalfast inte tillåter (använd "
"Ladda ned i Tidalfast för att lyssna offline)."

#: src/luna/mod.rs:369
msgid ""
"It needs TIDAL's own remote control code, which Tidalfast does not have."
msgstr "Den behöver TIDALs egen kod för fjärrkontroll, som Tidalfast inte har."

#: src/luna/mod.rs:373
msgid ""
"It sends your TIDAL sign-in to the author's server, which Tidalfast never "
"allows, so its remote control cannot run."
msgstr ""
"Den skickar din TIDAL-inloggning till upphovspersonens server, vilket "
"Tidalfast aldrig tillåter, så dess fjärrkontroll kan inte köras."

#: src/luna/mod.rs:377
msgid ""
"Its mini player is a separate browser window, which Tidalfast does not "
"include."
msgstr ""
"Dess minispelare är ett separat webbläsarfönster, som Tidalfast inte har."

#: src/luna/mod.rs:381
msgid ""
"It needs to listen for media keys across the whole computer, which Tidalfast "
"does not allow (Tidalfast has its own media controls)."
msgstr ""
"Den behöver lyssna efter mediatangenter i hela datorn, vilket Tidalfast inte "
"tillåter (Tidalfast har egna mediakontroller)."

#: src/luna/mod.rs:385
msgid ""
"It plays through the mpv program and talks to it over a channel Tidalfast "
"does not allow."
msgstr ""
"Den spelar upp via programmet mpv och pratar med det över en kanal som "
"Tidalfast inte tillåter."

#: src/luna/mod.rs:389
msgid ""
"It marks playlists inside TIDAL's web \"add to playlist\" window, which "
"Tidalfast does not have."
msgstr ""
"Den markerar spellistor i TIDALs webbfönster \"Lägg till i spellista\", som "
"Tidalfast inte har."

#: src/luna/mod.rs:393
msgid ""
"It needs a native add-on that Tidalfast cannot load (Tidalfast has its own "
"media controls)."
msgstr ""
"Den behöver ett inbyggt tillägg som Tidalfast inte kan läsa in (Tidalfast "
"har egna mediakontroller)."

#: src/luna/mod.rs:397
msgid ""
"Last.fm scrobbling needs TIDAL's own Last.fm key, which Tidalfast does not "
"have."
msgstr ""
"Last.fm-scrobbling behöver TIDALs egen Last.fm-nyckel, som Tidalfast inte "
"har."

#: src/luna/mod.rs:401
msgid ""
"The lyrics bubble over the player bar works, but its separate lyrics window "
"does not, because that needs a browser engine."
msgstr ""
"Låttextbubblan ovanför spelarfältet fungerar, men det separata "
"låttextfönstret gör det inte, eftersom det kräver en webbläsarmotor."

